        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 3, the game delivers throw back retro vibes that make every moment on the water feel like a serene escape. Whether you’re a seasoned fly fisher or new to the sport, <strong>Fishing on the Fly</strong> offers an unparalleled digital fishing experience that’s as close as you can get to the real thing without getting your feet wet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an immersive angling adventure with <strong>Fishing on the Fly</strong>—an indie game that takes fly fishing to the next level. Crafted with passion and precision by an ex-guide and solo developer Mac Clark, this game stands out as one of the few fishing simulations developed in the U.S.A. <strong>Fishing on the Fly</strong> offers gameplay experience enriched by genuine expertise and love for the sport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>explosive gameplay</strong> that captures the essence of real-world fly fishing. Navigate through beautifully rendered models of America’s most iconic blue-ribbon rivers. Test your skills by catching <strong>authentic trophy fish</strong>, each encounter designed to mirror the unpredictable nature of real-life fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing on the Fly</strong> presents a series of <strong>true-to-life fishing challenges</strong> that escalate in complexity, ensuring that every cast feels fresh and every catch is rewarding. The game’s <strong>original mechanics</strong> evolve as you progress, providing an enduring and satisfying challenge for anglers of all levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover:</strong> Unravel 14 chapters of fly fishing lore, unlocking <strong>mysteries</strong> and <strong>premium gear</strong> as you advance. <strong>Customize:</strong> Elevate your game with a wealth of <strong>equipment</strong>, <strong>rivers</strong>, and <strong>modes</strong>—all tailored to your growing skills. <strong>Adapt:</strong> Engage with <strong>real-world hatches</strong> that shift with the seasons, challenging even the most seasoned anglers. <strong>Experience:</strong> Witness <strong>stunning animations </strong>and <strong>acrobatic fish</strong>, creating a myriad of electrifying gameplay moments. <strong>Strategize:</strong> Employ <strong>authentic tactics</strong> to outsmart your aquatic adversaries, just as in real life. <strong>Explore: </strong>Navigate meticulously crafted replicas of the West’s most <strong>renowned rivers</strong>, based on precise USGS data. <strong>Earn:</strong> Collect <strong>Fish Bucks</strong> for your achievements and indulge in an extensive selection of in-game equipment and flies. <strong>Show Off:</strong> Exhibit your hard-won <strong>trophies</strong> and <strong>gear</strong> in your personal man cave, becoming the envy of friends. <strong>Encounter:</strong> Immerse yourself in an ecosystem teeming with <strong>wildlife</strong>—from majestic bears to diverse fish species.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 3, the game delivers throw back retro vibes that make every moment on the water feel like a serene escape. Whether you’re a seasoned fly fisher or new to the sport, <strong>Fishing on the Fly</strong> offers an unparalleled digital fishing experience that’s as close as you can get to the real thing without getting your feet wet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an immersive angling adventure with <strong>Fishing on the Fly</strong>—an indie game that takes fly fishing to the next level. Crafted with passion and precision by an ex-guide and solo developer Mac Clark, this game stands out as one of the few fishing simulations developed in the U.S.A. <strong>Fishing on the Fly</strong> offers gameplay experience enriched by genuine expertise and love for the sport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>explosive gameplay</strong> that captures the essence of real-world fly fishing. Navigate through beautifully rendered models of America’s most iconic blue-ribbon rivers. Test your skills by catching <strong>authentic trophy fish</strong>, each encounter designed to mirror the unpredictable nature of real-life fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing on the Fly</strong> presents a series of <strong>true-to-life fishing challenges</strong> that escalate in complexity, ensuring that every cast feels fresh and every catch is rewarding. The game’s <strong>original mechanics</strong> evolve as you progress, providing an enduring and satisfying challenge for anglers of all levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover:</strong> Unravel 14 chapters of fly fishing lore, unlocking <strong>mysteries</strong> and <strong>premium gear</strong> as you advance. <strong>Customize:</strong> Elevate your game with a wealth of <strong>equipment</strong>, <strong>rivers</strong>, and <strong>modes</strong>—all tailored to your growing skills. <strong>Adapt:</strong> Engage with <strong>real-world hatches</strong> that shift with the seasons, challenging even the most seasoned anglers. <strong>Experience:</strong> Witness <strong>stunning animations </strong>and <strong>acrobatic fish</strong>, creating a myriad of electrifying gameplay moments. <strong>Strategize:</strong> Employ <strong>authentic tactics</strong> to outsmart your aquatic adversaries, just as in real life. <strong>Explore: </strong>Navigate meticulously crafted replicas of the West’s most <strong>renowned rivers</strong>, based on precise USGS data. <strong>Earn:</strong> Collect <strong>Fish Bucks</strong> for your achievements and indulge in an extensive selection of in-game equipment and flies. <strong>Show Off:</strong> Exhibit your hard-won <strong>trophies</strong> and <strong>gear</strong> in your personal man cave, becoming the envy of friends. <strong>Encounter:</strong> Immerse yourself in an ecosystem teeming with <strong>wildlife</strong>—from majestic bears to diverse fish species.</p>",
        "short_description": "Dive into Fishing on the Fly, a U.S.-made indie fly fishing game with authentic and true-to-life fishing challenges. Perfect for future and experienced fly anglers alike!",
